tune on Sarubotoke Island."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wise and compassionate, the heiress holds down the fort for her ailing father. Yet, she can't hide her disdain for the curses and sinister ties that bind her family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I haven't changed... I've just finally faced the reality.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134343"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文鳴編のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"申仏島の呪われた資産家一族・二ツ栗家を継ぐ令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聡明かつ思いやりのある性格の娘で、病弱な老父に代わって家を支える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その一方で、呪いの世界や一族にまつわる忌まわしい因縁への嫌悪感を持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25268","sourceWorkId":"35830","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文鳴編のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"申仏島の呪われた資産家一族・二ツ栗家を継ぐ令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聡明かつ思いやりのある性格の娘で、病弱な老父に代わって家を支える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その一方で、呪いの世界や一族にまつわる忌まわしい因縁への嫌悪感を持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155083"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db9041f9be08806f8fd9151a0f3543726e54c3789a0dcd569ce471cde0dc3551.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6df2929484fda48a9cdcb2cc9792fdd053894e3e74bf6a88c5a406c314d04e4d.webp","width":104,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さいとうよしえ","creatorId":"vndb:s1545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1545","name":"さいとう よしえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:473191:155083:20696:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134383","characterName":"文鳴 啾蔵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155081","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"473191"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25269"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134383"},"originalCharacterName":"文鳴 啾蔵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the Fuminari Arc."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Living under the Futatsuguri family's roof, Shuuzou's a sorcerer whose trade is curse-induced murder. Known for his cynical nature, this middle-aged man prefers to speak and act in a deliberately villainous manner."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuzou still clings to the memory of his mentor, Enju, who passed away during his youth, even after all these years."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'm beat, Togetsu. Way I see it, you ain't gonna put my suspicions to rest, so that makes you an enemy.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134383"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文鳴編の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二ツ栗家に身を寄せる呪術師。呪詛で人を殺す稼業を生業とする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皮肉屋な性格で、ことさら露悪的な振る舞いやしゃべり方を好む中年男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少年時代に死別した師匠である「槐」の面影を、数十年経った今もなお引きずっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25269","sourceWorkId":"35830","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文鳴編の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二ツ栗家に身を寄せる呪術師。呪詛で人を殺す稼業を生業とする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皮肉屋な性格で、ことさら露悪的な振る舞いやしゃべり方を好む中年男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少年時代に死別した師匠である「槐」の面影を、数十年経った今もなお引きずっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155081"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f2a5a1658a11d70805aa6c87f8a2c96b300a91c94364d5441dc5b38d2cf8054.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f96d88adc9a70dfd350cf308501ca89ffcd82dd62d6db563f98712f472aaf0db.webp","width":95,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ニコイチ","creatorId":"vndb:s38316","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s38316","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s38316","name":"ニコイチ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96896","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134384","characterName":"兎口 姫奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155085","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"473191"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25273"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134384"},"originalCharacterName":"兎口 姫奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The queen bee at Oujo, the 'King's Castle,' the premier brothel in Sarubotoke Island's red-light district."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attracted by tales of its unparalleled earnings, Himena left the hustle of Tokyo for the allure of Sarubotoke Island. Sporting the striking, Shiro-Gyaru fashion, she commands attention with her bold style and infectious smile. Her dazzling looks and captivating presence keep her admirers returning, ensuring her spot at the top."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Hey, feel like getting a little cozy with Hime?\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134384"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"申仏島歓楽街の娼館「王城」のナンバーワン娼婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異例なほど稼ぎがいい場所という噂を聞き、東京から申仏島へと渡ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サバサバした性格で明るく、抜群のルックスとスタイルで人気を集める都会的な白ギャル。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25273","sourceWorkId":"35830","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"申仏島歓楽街の娼館「王城」のナンバーワン娼婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異例なほど稼ぎがいい場所という噂を聞き、東京から申仏島へと渡ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バサバした性格で明るく、抜群のルックスとスタイルで人気を集める都会的な白ギャル。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155085"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/776716241e86d0a1c0ffe5fb785d8d205bed96488f45bf310e1905390edcad16.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/