doringly calls him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Hey, Uncle. Mind giving me a head pat?\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134387"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある目的のために申仏島へ渡る四人組の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ年端もいかない少女ながら、性的にはかなり奔放で大人びた性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在の保護者は荒忌善次郎で、おっちゃんと呼び慕っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25277","sourceWorkId":"35830","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある目的のために申仏島へ渡る四人組の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ年端もいかない少女ながら、性的にはかなり奔放で大人びた性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在の保護者は荒忌善次郎で、おっちゃんと呼び慕っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155086"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a66aece46e6a2a19865134086b1594f6f39e0eccab20478d749448036206296a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df906e4e697fdafff811d1db8eab93e2f9dc951fbb7d1ec4adce46fe6d4f1997.webp","width":111,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"綿雨たべ子","creatorId":"vndb:s33851","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s33851","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s33851","name":"綿雨 たべ子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:473191:155086:64525:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134397","characterName":"苦松 刑部","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155087","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"473191"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25270"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134397"},"originalCharacterName":"苦松 刑部","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A wandering curse-slinger and martial artist hired by the Futatsuguri family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite being nearly 60, Gyobu's well-