employed by the Futatsuguri family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fujihiko is a handsome youth who possesses an unwavering loyalty to Tamayo, his childhood friend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From a young age, he honed his skills in ancient martial arts, studying under the guidance of Kumatsu Gyobu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"That's why I want to protect Tamayo-sama from any danger.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134398"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"二ツ栗家に仕える使用人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"影のように無口な美青年で、幼友達でもある珠夜に対する忠誠心に篤い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少年時代から苦松刑部に師事した古流武術を修めている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25271","sourceWorkId":"35830","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"二ツ栗家に仕える使用人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"影のように無口な美青年で、幼友達でもある珠夜に対する忠誠心に篤い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少年時代から苦松刑部に師事した古流武術を修めている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155088"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d16b756f08e5ac96c3163010606b6542d0fad97bbff223cc31359057bc076c28.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/82685edaa630878ee00055eb93309afa50aa984c57dc3da96851bea63d5463a3.webp","width":97,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"志藤春道","creatorId":"vndb:s37294","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37294","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37294","name":"志藤 春道","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:473191:155088:68353:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134399","characterName":"二ツ栗 宗孝","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155089","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"473191"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25272"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134399"},"originalCharacterName":"二ツ栗 宗孝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tamayo's uncle who manages the shady side of the Futatsuguri family's business."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Munetaka handles Sarubotoke Island's red-light district and keeps the working girls in line. He's not exactly thrilled about Tamayo taking the reins as the family head and has a reputation for being a real hardass about everything."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Deal with curses or divine retributions away from me, please....\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134399"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"珠夜の叔父に当たる人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二ツ栗家の中では、申仏島歓楽街の暗部と女たちの管理を任されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"珠夜が一族の当主となったことに不満を持ち、万事につけ当たりが強い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25272","sourceWorkId":"35830","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"珠夜の叔父に当たる人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二ツ栗家の中では、申仏島歓楽街の暗部と女たちの管理を任されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"珠夜が一族の当主となったことに不満を持ち、万事につけ当たりが強い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155089"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/40f9a99a6ea53cf655847d039958c0b3c15ef5f83d561deca652abffe264edf5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0dbcc673467caef45865c21deee51137bcf7fcab72099c74143ce7cb652f4605.webp","width":100,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡井カツノリ","creatorId":"vndb:s28622","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28622","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28622","name":"岡井 カツノリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:473191:155089:21275:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134400","characterName":"荒忌 善次郎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155090","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"473191"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25276"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134400"},"originalCharacterName":"荒忌 善次郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The head honcho of the \"Arai-gumi,\" a small-time yakuza group under Kobe Y-gumi's umbrella."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zenjirou has enlisted the services of Togetsu and his associates to pursue an objective, embarking upon a voyage to Sarubotoke Island."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Exhibiting a flamboyant yet superficial character, he embodies the typical Kansai penchant for humor, demanding quality in jest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Man, I could clone myself a hundred times, and it still wouldn't be enough!\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134400"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神戸Ｙ組系五次団体の零細暴力団「荒忌組」の組長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある目的のために吐月らを雇い、申仏島へ渡る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"俗っぽい軽薄な性格で、関西人らしく笑いにはうるさい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25276","sourceWorkId":"35830","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神戸Ｙ組系五次団体の零細暴力団「荒忌組」の組長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある目的のために吐月らを雇い、申仏島へ渡る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"俗っぽい軽薄な性格で、関西人らしく笑いにはうるさい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155090"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/368dcf5c7a96b7b9f01ada350455c122c15cfb8f2dd096cda9e77d8ca84b0adc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b930ad2cd3d02c22f243518bbb6388a7c4a4d2a0a068df1984535487839f6961.webp","width":102,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ハリーマオー","creatorId":"vndb:s38322","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s38322","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s38322","name":"ハリーマオー","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96897","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c134401","characterName":"槐","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"155091","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"473191"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25278"],"vndbCharacterId":"c134401"},"originalCharacterName":"槐","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"31"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A person of the past who passed away in 1986 at 31."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Enju was the adoptive parent and mentor of Shuuzou, an orphaned boy. As a skilled sorcerer (cursed technique user), she taught Shuuzou the ways of jujutsu. Her life was tragically cut short when she died in a particular incident."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"But..... you see, we're cut from the same cloth, you and I. 'Cause at the end of the day, Shuuzou's all I've got.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134401"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"故人。昭和61年没。享年31歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孤児であった文鳴啾蔵の育ての親にして師匠である呪術師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある事件で命を落とす。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25278","sourceWorkId":"35830","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"故人。昭和61年没。享年31歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孤児であった文鳴啾蔵の育ての親にして師匠である呪術師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある事件で命を落とす。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"155091"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a6a313dfab766b762d8c809cc67eefb84da20f5ff5ebe2ff1a58da888368bd2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/190dd96272f6b803c561de6d0fa7ca2adb4cf192a8f0620982ef1d4ceecfe717.webp","width":100,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors"